---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Info - Explicit Studio" description="Explicit Studio is a full cycle creative studio led by Srijan Mahajan, creating monopolising brands for technology startups.">

  <!-- Studio Philosophy -->
  <section class="info-philosophy reveal">
    <h1 class="info-philosophy__headline">Look hard enough & there's an interesting story everywhere. Including B2B SaaS.</h1>
    <div class="info-philosophy__body">
      <p>We believe tech startups will become the consumer brands of tomorrow. Which means they can't just be functional anymore. They have to mean something. They have to make people feel something.</p>
      <p>Explicit exists at the intersection of art & technology to help startups build brands that people remember, trust, and talk about.</p>
      <p>You've made something the world needs. <strong>Make it Explicit.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- We Believe -->
  <section class="info-beliefs reveal">
    <h2 class="info-beliefs__title">We Believe</h2>
    <div class="info-beliefs__list">
      <div class="info-beliefs__item">
        <h3>Tech is culture.</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="info-beliefs__item">
        <h3>The story is part of the product.</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="info-beliefs__item">
        <h3>A good brand is a business advantage.</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="info-beliefs__item">
        <h3>Startups die when they stop taking creative risk.</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Srijan -->
  <section class="info-about reveal">
    <div class="info-about__grid">
      <div class="info-about__body">
        <p>I'm Srijan. I've spent my life thinking about what makes people pay attention & build trust.</p>
        <p>I started playing drums at 15, became the drummer for Parikrama, played with Shubha Mudgal, opened for Iron Maiden, and performed at The Kennedy Centre - 1000+ concerts across the world. Then I spent years in film and advertising learning how stories work, what makes them stick, and what makes them forgettable.</p>
        <p>Then I started building startups. I built Pause, a mental health platform that broke its category with its positioning, and Attis, India's first biohacking & longevity community. Building those taught me what agencies will never understand - what it actually feels like to be a founder. That's why I built Explicit.</p>
        <p>You can learn more about me <a href="https://srijanmahajan.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-about__portrait">
        <img src="/images/srijan-portrait.JPG" alt="Srijan Mahajan" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="info-services reveal">
    <div class="info-services__inner">
      <h2 class="info-services__title">How We Work</h2>
      <div class="info-services__intro">
        <p>We don't have account managers, elaborate processes, or bloated teams. You talk to me & a handpicked team of designers, developers, copywriters, motion artists, and strategists. We understand your startup, we move fast, and we build things that work. No scope creep, no surprise invoices, no design-by-committee.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-services__offers">
        <div class="info-services__offer">
          <h3>Brand Sprint - 4 Weeks</h3>
          <p class="info-services__offer-sub">Positioning, narrative, and messaging that make you impossible to ignore.</p>
          <p class="info-services__offer-label">What you walk away with:</p>
          <div class="info-services__deliverables">
            <p>&rarr; Brand positioning & messaging framework</p>
            <p>&rarr; Brand voice & tone guidelines</p>
            <p>&rarr; 90-day content strategy</p>
            <p>&rarr; Investor deck</p>
            <p>&rarr; 30 days of post-launch support</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary info-services__offer-cta">Get in touch <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-services__offer">
          <h3>Primer - 5 Week Launch Sprint</h3>
          <p class="info-services__offer-sub">The complete launch sprint for early-stage startups. By Explicit × <a href="https://www.studioinfer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Studio Infer</a>.</p>
          <p class="info-services__offer-label">What you walk away with:</p>
          <div class="info-services__deliverables">
            <p>&rarr; Brand positioning & messaging framework</p>
            <p>&rarr; Brand identity & visual system</p>
            <p>&rarr; Designed and developed website</p>
            <p>&rarr; Brand guidelines</p>
            <p>&rarr; ~10 hours of your time. We handle the rest.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="btn-primary info-services__offer-cta">Learn more <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-services__offer">
          <h3>Monthly Partnership - Ongoing</h3>
          <p class="info-services__offer-sub">An embedded creative partner across storytelling, growth, and GTM. Your CMO, creative director, and intern - owning strategy and execution from inside the org.</p>
          <p class="info-services__offer-label">What this looks like:</p>
          <div class="info-services__deliverables">
            <p>&rarr; Embedded within the team</p>
            <p>&rarr; Storytelling, growth, and GTM under one roof</p>
            <p>&rarr; Campaigns, content, advertising creatives and copy</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary info-services__offer-cta">Get in touch <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-services__offer">
          <h3>1:1 with Srijan</h3>
          <p class="info-services__offer-sub">Not ready for a full engagement? Book a 1:1 session or a brand strategy workshop with Srijan to work through anything - brand positioning, go-to-market strategy, growth challenges, content direction, or whatever's keeping you up at night.</p>
          <div class="info-services__deliverables"></div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary info-services__offer-cta">Book now <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ===== Philosophy ===== */
  .info-philosophy {
    padding: 40px var(--section-padding-x) var(--section-padding-y);
  }

  .info-philosophy__headline {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .info-philosophy__body {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .info-philosophy__body p {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .info-philosophy__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .info-philosophy__body strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ===== We Believe ===== */
  .info-beliefs {
    padding: 0 var(--section-padding-x) var(--section-padding-y);
  }

  .info-beliefs__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .info-beliefs__list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .info-beliefs__item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 24px 0;
  }

  .info-beliefs__item h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ===== About Srijan ===== */
  .info-about {
    padding: var(--section-padding-y) var(--section-padding-x);
  }

  .info-about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .info-about__body p {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .info-about__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .info-about__body a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .info-about__body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .info-about__portrait {
    position: sticky;
    top: 40px;
  }

  .info-about__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  /* ===== How We Work ===== */
  .info-services {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--section-padding-y) var(--section-padding-x);
    background: url('/images/services-bg.jpg') center / cover no-repeat;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .info-services::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.75);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .info-services__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .info-services__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .info-services__intro {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .info-services__intro p {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .info-services__intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .info-services__intro strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .info-services__offers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .info-services__offer {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .info-services__offer h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .info-services__offer-sub {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .info-services__offer-label {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .info-services__deliverables p {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .info-services__offer-price {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .info-services__deliverables {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .info-services__offer-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-top: 24px;
    align-self: flex-end;
  }

  .info-services__offer-sub a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .info-services__offer-sub a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  /* ===== CTA ===== */
  .info-cta {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: var(--section-padding-y) var(--section-padding-x);
  }

  .info-cta__inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .info-cta__inner h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .info-cta__button {
    padding: 16px 40px;
  }

  .info-cta__email {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .info-cta__email:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .info-about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .info-about__portrait {
      position: static;
      order: -1;
    }

    .info-services__offers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .info-services__offer {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .info-beliefs__item h3 {
      font-size: var(--text-h3);
    }
  }
</style>
